<section class="ngw-faq" aria-labelledby="ngw-faq-title">
  <div class="ngw-faq-inner">
    <h2 id="ngw-faq-title">Quick answers</h2>
    <dl class="ngw-faq-list">
      <dt>What is Neural Gains Weekly?</dt>
      <dd>A free newsletter for professionals who have to use AI at work. Each full issue explains one AI concept in plain English, gives you a prompt you can copy, and shows what Santosh learned building that week.</dd>
      <dt>Who is it for?</dt>
      <dd>Non-technical professionals in healthcare and other complex industries who want to go from using AI to building with it. No coding background needed.</dd>
      <dt>How often does it arrive?</dt>
      <dd>One email every Tuesday. A full issue one week, a short note with the best lesson from the newest podcast episode the next.</dd>
      <dt>What is Explore AI Out Loud?</dt>
      <dd>The video podcast Santosh co-hosts with Brandon Ratay. Two professionals at different points in their AI learning, working through real projects out loud. New episodes every other Tuesday on YouTube, Spotify and Apple Podcasts.</dd>
      <dt>Does it cost anything?</dt>
      <dd>No. The newsletter and the podcast are free. Readers who want to back the work can choose a paid supporter tier, but nothing is behind a paywall.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
